{"/hero/index.html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Nuvio \u00b7 Colour Celluloid</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{background:#0b0c10;color:#eee;font:15px system-ui;margin:0}main{max-width:1200px;padding:48px 24px;margin:auto}h1{font-size:44px;letter-spacing:-2px;margin:8px 0}p{color:#a3adbc;line-height:1.7}.eyebrow{color:#e5bf89;letter-spacing:3px;font-size:11px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;margin-top:36px}article{background:#131720;border:1px solid #2b3240;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden}article>div{padding:22px}video{width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;display:block;background:#000}h2{margin:0}article p{font-size:12px;min-height:58px}button{padding:12px 18px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:#e6ca9d;cursor:pointer}a{color:#b8c8dd;font-size:13px;margin-left:15px}small{display:block;margin-top:16px;color:#8b9bb0}@media(max-width:650px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}h1{font-size:34px}}</style><main><div class=\"eyebrow\">YOUR CINEMA, IN MOTION</div><h1>Cinema, refreshed.</h1><p>The latest IndianRegional movie-catalog entries join all eight original films in each language. Compact projector, larger posters, smoother reels and your uploaded soundtracks. These permanent MP4 URLs are checked daily and regenerated when the catalog artwork changes.</p><p>1280 \u00d7 720 \u00b7 16:9 \u00b7 H.264 + AAC \u00b7 30 fps \u00b7 50 seconds. Nuvio\u2019s visible crop varies by layout. Catalogs may include upcoming titles; \u201clatest\u201d follows their ordering.</p><section class=\"grid\"><article><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/hero/hindi-daily.jpg\" src=\"/hero/hindi.mp4\"></video><div><h2>Hindi</h2><p>12 latest catalog entries + 8 retained originals</p><p>Gajab Raat \u00b7 Reporting Live \u00b7 Zakir Khan: Papa Yaar \u00b7 Lust Stories 3 \u00b7 Gandhari \u00b7 Babita Singh Reporting \u00b7 Awarapan 2 \u00b7 Ohh My Dog \u00b7 Ikka \u00b7 Dhamaal 4 \u00b7 Baby Do Die Do \u00b7 Satluj \u00b7 Sholay \u00b7 Dilwale Dulhania Le Jayenge \u00b7 Lagaan \u00b7 3 Idiots \u00b7 Dangal \u00b7 Mughal-e-Azam \u00b7 Pyaasa \u00b7 Gangs of Wasseypur</p><p class=\"song\">\u266b RHTDM \u2014 supplied instrumental<br><small>Continuous supplied soundtrack, synchronised with the opening and closing fades.</small></p><button data-url=\"/hero/hindi.mp4\">Copy daily MP4 URL</button> <a href=\"/hero/hindi.mp4\" target=\"_blank\">Open MP4 \u2197</a><small>6.91 MB \u00b7 50 seconds \u00b7 30 fps<br>Catalog checked: 2026-10-29</small></div></article><article><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/hero/tamil-daily.jpg\" src=\"/hero/tamil.mp4\"></video><div><h2>Tamil</h2><p>12 latest catalog entries + 8 retained originals</p><p>Obstacle \u00b7 Baththa \u00b7 Captain Dynamite \u00b7 Oviyam \u00b7 Dorothy \u00b7 Mandaadi \u00b7 Sardar 2 \u00b7 Hi :) \u00b7 Modha Rathri \u00b7 Ram and Leela \u00b7 Pyaar Prema Kalyanam \u00b7 Ananya&#x27;s Call \u00b7 Nayakan \u00b7 Baashha \u00b7 Anbe Sivam \u00b7 Enthiran \u00b7 Vikram \u00b7 Vikram Vedha \u00b7 Kaithi \u00b7 Ponniyin Selvan: I</p><p class=\"song\">\u266b Thuli Thuli \u2014 Paiya<br><small>Continuous supplied soundtrack, synchronised with the opening and closing fades.</small></p><button data-url=\"/hero/tamil.mp4\">Copy daily MP4 URL</button> <a href=\"/hero/tamil.mp4\" target=\"_blank\">Open MP4 \u2197</a><small>6.90 MB \u00b7 50 seconds \u00b7 30 fps<br>Catalog checked: 2026-10-29</small></div></article><article><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/hero/malayalam-daily.jpg\" src=\"/hero/malayalam.mp4\"></video><div><h2>Malayalam</h2><p>12 latest catalog entries + 8 retained originals</p><p>Avaraachan &amp; Sons \u00b7 Marven \u00b7 Dhoomakethu \u00b7 Oru Anweshanathinte Thudakkam \u00b7 Aasha \u00b7 Adinaasam Vellapokkam \u00b7 It&#x27;s a Medical Miracle \u00b7 Khalifa \u00b7 Pradhama Drishtiya Kuttakkar \u00b7 Antappante Athbudha Pravarthikal \u00b7 Bethlehem Kudumba Unit \u00b7 Abhirami \u00b7 Manichitrathazhu \u00b7 Drishyam \u00b7 Kireedam \u00b7 Chithram \u00b7 Kumbalangi Nights \u00b7 Premam \u00b7 Bangalore Days \u00b7 Aavesham</p><p class=\"song\">\u266b Oru Kari Mukilinu<br><small>Continuous supplied soundtrack, synchronised with the opening and closing fades.</small></p><button data-url=\"/hero/malayalam.mp4\">Copy daily MP4 URL</button> <a href=\"/hero/malayalam.mp4\" target=\"_blank\">Open MP4 \u2197</a><small>6.90 MB \u00b7 50 seconds \u00b7 30 fps<br>Catalog checked: 2026-10-29</small></div></article><article><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/hero/telugu-daily.jpg\" src=\"/hero/telugu.mp4\"></video><div><h2>Telugu</h2><p>12 latest catalog entries + 8 retained originals</p><p>The Paradise \u00b7 Mahendragiri Vaaraahi \u00b7 Epic - First Semester \u00b7 Irumudi \u00b7 Hushar Pittalu \u00b7 Pallaburusu \u00b7 Agadha \u00b7 KJQ \u00b7 Korean Kanakaraju \u00b7 Newton&#x27;s 3rd Law \u00b7 Srinivasa Mangapuram \u00b7 Chennai Love Story \u00b7 Mayabazar \u00b7 Sankarabharanam \u00b7 Magadheera \u00b7 Eega \u00b7 Baahubali: The Beginning \u00b7 Baahubali 2: The Conclusion \u00b7 RRR \u00b7 Pushpa: The Rise</p><p class=\"song\">\u266b Oka Pranam<br><small>Continuous supplied soundtrack, synchronised with the opening and closing fades.</small></p><button data-url=\"/hero/telugu.mp4\">Copy daily MP4 URL</button> <a href=\"/hero/telugu.mp4\" target=\"_blank\">Open MP4 \u2197</a><small>6.90 MB \u00b7 50 seconds \u00b7 30 fps<br>Catalog checked: 2026-10-29</small></div></article></section><p>Soundtracks use your uploaded recordings. The Hindi upload is instrumental; the other three use vocal recordings. Film posters and music remain the work of their respective owners. <a href=\"music-credits.json\">Music credits</a> <a href=\"credits.json\">Poster sources</a></p></main><script>for(const b of document.querySelectorAll('button'))b.onclick=async()=>{const u=new URL(b.dataset.url,location.href).href;try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(u);b.textContent='Copied \u2713'}catch{prompt('Copy MP4 URL',u)}};</script></html>", "/index.html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Four cinematic language cards. Preview the animation and copy direct public GIF and JPG links for Nuvio.\">\n<title>Cinema in motion \u2014 Nuvio Star Cards</title>\n<style>\n:root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#08090b;--panel:#111216;--line:#25262d;--muted:#999ca8;--red:#f2384e}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:#f7f7fa;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif}header,main,footer{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;padding:0 28px}header{height:88px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.brand{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2.5px;font-weight:800}.brand i{display:inline-block;width:7px;height:19px;background:var(--red);vertical-align:middle;margin-right:12px}.header-note{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.intro{padding:64px 0 38px;max-width:760px}.eyebrow{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2.2px;font-weight:700;color:var(--red);text-transform:uppercase}h1{font-size:clamp(34px,6vw,62px);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-2.7px;margin:16px 0}p{font-size:15px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65;margin:0}.specs{margin-top:22px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.5px;color:#c7c9d0}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:30px 24px}.card{overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:var(--panel)}.media{position:relative;aspect-ratio:16/9;background:#050507}.media img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain}.play{position:absolute;bottom:14px;right:14px;border:1px solid #ffffff35;border-radius:50px;background:#09090cc9;backdrop-filter:blur(9px);color:white;font-size:11px;padding:9px 13px;cursor:pointer}.info{padding:22px}.title-row{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:14px}.title-row h2{font-size:20px;font-weight:600;margin:0}.title-row span{color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.4px;text-transform:uppercase}.cast{min-height:40px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#9b9da7;margin-bottom:20px}.actions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}.copy{border:1px solid #3b3d47;background:transparent;color:#eeeef4;border-radius:7px;padding:12px 8px;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;transition:border-color .2s,background .2s}.copy:hover,.copy:focus-visible{border-color:var(--red);background:#ef334013}.download-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:13px;font-size:11px}.download-row a{color:#a1a4af;text-decoration:none}.download-row a:hover{color:#fff}.guide{margin-top:42px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:30px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 2fr;gap:24px}.guide h3{font-size:14px;margin:0}.guide p{font-size:13px}.guide strong{font-weight:500;color:#f5f5f8}footer{margin-top:50px;padding-top:25px;padding-bottom:32px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:11px;color:#777b88;line-height:1.7}details{margin-top:12px}summary{cursor:pointer}#credits{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:7px 20px;margin-top:14px}#credits a{color:#a6a9b6;text-decoration:none}#status{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:24px;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#f2f2f5;color:#08090b;border-radius:8px;padding:13px 20px;font-size:13px;box-shadow:0 5px 30px #0008;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .2s}button:focus-visible,a:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--red);outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:650px){header,main,footer{padding-left:18px;padding-right:18px}header{height:70px}.header-note{font-size:10px}.brand{font-size:11px}.intro{padding:42px 0 28px}h1{letter-spacing:-1.7px}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:22px}.info{padding:19px}.guide{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px}#credits{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.specs{line-height:1.8}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header><div class=\"brand\"><i></i>NUVIO STAR CARDS</div><div class=\"header-note\">FOUR LANGUAGES. ONE CINEMATIC SET.</div></header>\n<main>\n<section class=\"intro\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">Made for your collection</div><h1>Cinema in motion.</h1><p>Eight regional stars glide in as larger rounded, dimensional photo cards along a smooth curve, building a native-script title over the original cultural backgrounds. Sculpted 3D edges, upward spotlights and coordinated colour, with the original corner symbols.</p><div class=\"specs\">1920 \u00d7 1080 JPG &nbsp; / &nbsp; 640 \u00d7 360 GIF &nbsp; / &nbsp; 8 STARS PER LANGUAGE \u00b7 9.1-SECOND LOOPS</div><p style=\"margin-top:20px\"><a style=\"color:#dfc294\" href=\"/hero/\">Preview the four MP4 hero videos \u2197</a></p></section>\n<section class=\"grid\" id=\"gallery\" aria-label=\"Language cards\"></section>\n<section class=\"guide\"><h3>Ready for Nuvio.</h3><p>For slower connections, use the smaller JPG covers. Copy a <strong>JPG URL</strong> into the collection\u2019s cover image field. Copy its matching <strong>GIF URL</strong> into the focus animation field. These buttons copy the direct image address, with no sign-in or preview page between Nuvio and the file.</p></section>\n</main>\n<footer>Personal cinema artwork. Portraits are sourced from the linked Wikipedia / Wikimedia pages. No affiliation with the featured performers or a streaming service.<details><summary>Portrait sources</summary><div id=\"credits\"></div></details></footer>\n<div id=\"status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n<script>\nconst languages=[{id:'hindi',native:'\u0939\u093f\u0928\u094d\u0926\u0940',name:'Hindi'},{id:'tamil',native:'\u0ba4\u0bae\u0bbf\u0bb4\u0bcd',name:'Tamil'},{id:'malayalam',native:'\u0d2e\u0d32\u0d2f\u0d3e\u0d33\u0d02',name:'Malayalam'},{id:'telugu',native:'\u0c24\u0c46\u0c32\u0c41\u0c17\u0c41',name:'Telugu'}];\nlet assets={};\nlet timer;\nfunction toast(text){const s=document.getElementById('status');s.textContent=text;s.style.opacity=1;clearTimeout(timer);timer=setTimeout(()=>s.style.opacity=0,2500)}\nasync function copyUrl(path){const url=new URL(path,location.href).href;try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(url);toast('Direct image URL copied')}catch{window.prompt('Copy this direct image URL',url)}}\nasync function init(){const [manifest,credits]=await Promise.all([fetch('assets/manifest-public-v16.json').then(r=>r.json()),fetch('assets/credits.json').then(r=>r.json())]);assets=manifest;const gallery=document.getElementById('gallery');\nlanguages.forEach(l=>{const a=manifest[l.id];const actors=credits.filter(c=>c.language===l.id).map(c=>c.name);const card=document.createElement('article');card.className='card';card.innerHTML=`<div class=\"media\"><img src=\"${a.jpg}\" alt=\"${l.name} language formed from portraits of its cinema stars\" width=\"720\" height=\"405\" loading=\"lazy\"><button class=\"play\" aria-label=\"Play ${l.name} animation\">\u25b6 Play animation</button></div><div class=\"info\"><div class=\"title-row\"><h2 lang=\"${{hindi:'hi',tamil:'ta',malayalam:'ml',telugu:'te'}[l.id]}\">${l.native}</h2><span>${l.name}</span></div><div class=\"cast\">${actors.join(' \u00b7 ')}</div><div class=\"actions\"><button class=\"copy\" data-type=\"gif\">Copy GIF URL \u2197</button><button class=\"copy\" data-type=\"jpg\">Copy JPG URL \u2197</button></div><div class=\"download-row\"><a href=\"${a.gif}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open GIF \u00b7 ${a.gif_mb} MB</a><a href=\"${a.jpg}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open JPG \u00b7 ${a.jpg_kb} KB</a></div></div>`;\nconst img=card.querySelector('img');let playing=false;const play=card.querySelector('.play');play.onclick=()=>{playing=!playing;img.src=playing?a.gif:a.jpg;play.textContent=playing?'\u2161 Show still':'\u25b6 Play animation';play.setAttribute('aria-label',`${playing?'Pause':'Play'} ${l.name} animation`)};card.querySelectorAll('.copy').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>copyUrl(a[b.dataset.type]));gallery.appendChild(card)});\nconst c=document.getElementById('credits');credits.forEach(person=>{const link=document.createElement('a');link.href=person.source;link.target='_blank';link.rel='noopener';link.textContent=person.name+' \u2197';c.appendChild(link)})}\ninit().catch(()=>{document.getElementById('gallery').textContent='The cards could not be loaded. Please refresh the page.'});\n</script>\n</body></html>\n"}